<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S9" title="In Do LLMs Understand Wine Descriptors Across Cultures? A Benchmark for Cultural Adaptations of Wine Reviews" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">9 </span>Limitation</span></a></li>
